Scope of this licence

The MIT licence above covers the Ask Queen extension's own code only: the files
shipped in the extension package. It grants no rights in the QUEEN model, its
weights, the servers that host it, or the text they return.

Attribution: QUEEN

Ask Queen sends chess positions to QUEEN (princeton-nlp/queen_pawn-8), a chess
language model published by Princeton NLP:

  Model card: https://huggingface.co/princeton-nlp/queen_pawn-8
  Paper:      arXiv:2610.03695

The extension does not contain, bundle or redistribute the model or its
weights. It reaches the model through community-run Hugging Face Spaces
(boneyland/queen-pawn-8 and hugging-apps/queen-pawn-8) that are operated by
their own owners.

Licence status of QUEEN: no blanket licence is asserted for the combined
weights. Anyone who hosts, copies or redistributes the model must check the
model card and the terms of its components for themselves.

Ask Queen is unofficial. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by Chess.com,
Lichess, Princeton NLP or Hugging Face.
